#: scenario8:scenario8_99D8C435_D1A6_4250_BEE5_FAF503B4FCAE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8477e7264f528293e4c790460ef2fd644a808a1d16b039ba11f41be1eebaddb2
